          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abantu bwe banaasoolanga memale owundi n'akuba mwine eibaale, oba n'amufunta ekifunsi, ole ye bakubye n'atafa aye n'agwa ku ndiri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bw'anaawonangamu n'aba ng'asobola okukoomera ku mwigo okujaaku ku luya, eyamukuba taabengaku musango. Aye aidha kusasuliranga ye yakuba olw'ebiseera bye by'anaabanga ng'afiiriirwa, era amwidhandhabenga okutuusa lw'anaawoneranga irala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
